{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05739","headline":"夏晚初霁南省寓直用余字 · 厍狄履温","name":"夏晚初霁南省寓直用余字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"薄宦因时泰，凉宵寓直初。\n沈沈仙阁闭，的的暗更徐。\n霁色连空上，炎氛入夜除。\n星回南斗落，月度北窗虚。\n待漏残灯照，含芳袭气余。\n寐来冠不解，奏罢草仍书。\n幕府慙良策，明曹媿散樗。\n命轻徒有报，义重更难疎。\n燕厦欣成托，鵷行滥所如。\n晨趋当及早，复此戒朝车。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"厍狄履温","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05739.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05739","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}